sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Tel as Telephony / SIP
    participant Vapi as Vapi Voice Orchestrator
    participant STT as Deepgram Nova-2
    participant LLM as GPT-4o / GPT-4o-mini
    participant API as Mock Webhook API
    participant TTS as ElevenLabs / Cartesia

    Customer->>Tel: Answers outbound call
    Tel->>Vapi: Stream audio
    Vapi->>STT: Audio stream
    STT-->>Vapi: Transcript
    Vapi->>LLM: State + transcript
    LLM-->>Vapi: Greeting / verification request
    Vapi->>TTS: Response text
    TTS-->>Customer: Spoken response
    Customer->>Vapi: Verification code
    Vapi->>LLM: Transcript + AUTH_PENDING
    LLM->>API: verify_customer(...)
    API-->>LLM: verified=true/false
    alt Verification successful
        LLM-->>Vapi: Disclose permitted debt details
        Customer->>Vapi: Promise to pay
        LLM->>API: log_promise_to_pay(...)
        API-->>LLM: PTP recorded
        LLM->>API: send_payment_link(...)
        API-->>LLM: Link sent
        LLM->>API: mark_disposition(PTP_AGREED)
    else Verification failed
        LLM-->>Vapi: Do not disclose debt
        LLM->>API: mark_disposition(...)
    end
    Vapi-->>Customer: Polite closing
    Vapi->>Tel: End call
